{"id":"d2e0e7710413332a","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-cpo.md","title":"Complete Partial Order","display":"df-cpo — Complete Partial Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cpo","aliases":["58-df-cpo","Complete Partial Order"],"display":"df-cpo — Complete Partial Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cpo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cpo</span><span>Complete Partial Order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cpo — Complete Partial Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in V\">\\(D\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\,\\subseteq D\\times D\">\\(\\leq\\,\\subseteq D\\times D\\)</span> (ordered carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO}_S(D,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO}_S(D,\\leq)\\)</span> (complete-partial-order predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cpo} \\vdash \\mathrm{CPO}_S(D,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\land\\exists\\bot\\in D\\;\\Bigl[\\forall x\\in D\\;(\\langle\\bot,x\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;\\Bigl(X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,s\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cpo} \\vdash \\mathrm{CPO}_S(D,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\land\\exists\\bot\\in D\\;\\Bigl[\\forall x\\in D\\;(\\langle\\bot,x\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;\\Bigl(X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,s\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bottom witness scopes over the whole clause, and all order comparisons use membership in the declared relation graph.</li>\n<li>Directed set: every finite subset has an upper bound in the set</li>\n<li>Fixed point theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\perp\">\\(\\perp\\)</span>-continuous <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: D \\to D\">\\(f: D \\to D\\)</span> has least fixed point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{n} f^n(\\bot)\">\\(\\bigvee_{n} f^n(\\bot)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Function space: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D \\to E]\">\\([D \\to E]\\)</span> ordered pointwise; is CPO if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is CPO</li>\n<li>Applications: denotational semantics, fixed point semantics of programs</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Abramsky and Jung, Domain Theory</li>\n<li>Winskel, The Formal Semantics of Programming Languages</li>\n<li>Gunter, Semantics of Programming Languages</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\,\\subseteq D\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO}_S(D,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cpo} \\vdash \\mathrm{CPO}_S(D,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(D,\\leq)\\land\\exists\\bot\\in D\\;\\Bigl[\\forall x\\in D\\;(\\langle\\bot,x\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;\\Bigl(X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\to\\exists s\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,s\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"f: D \\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{n} f^n(\\bot)","display":false},{"tex":"[D \\to E]","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[{"id":"8ffdd76172ba4225","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"87846ecce8309a1b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R)$ is the canonical complete-partial-order predicate, including a least element and suprema of all nonempty directed subsets (see [[58-df-cpo]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-cpo.md|58-df-cpo]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}